  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_11"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "12:21 P.M.\n切尔诺伯格分城“14区”废墟\n区块地面"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雪怪小队，为什么停火了？你们还在等什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......把这些废墟挖开啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不是布置好了源石吗？为什么不直接弄塌地块，把罗德岛一网打尽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "开啥玩笑，霜星大姊还在这底下啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就由我们来消灭罗德岛，你们继续挖。我们马上赶到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别来这条街区！这区块的地面结构已经破破烂烂的了，没受过训练的队伍在这里进行战斗，一不小心就会诱发大崩溃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剿灭罗德岛是优先事项，你们自己动手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "指这指那的烦不烦啊......该打的肯定要打，你这个优先事项是谁制定的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自然是最高战略目标。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们对着乌萨斯人泄私愤的时候考虑过战略目标吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行行好，我们尽量，你们能不能宽容下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们难道......和罗德岛进行了交流？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在背叛我们的运动！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（你们那怎么回事？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（感觉得打一场，逃不掉了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你们觉得只要有交流那就是背叛，行啊，那就是了行吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就这种战术思想，也难怪被人牵着鼻子走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......雪怪！你们要做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的人数可是比你们多了好几倍，别犯蠢！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等，我们可是和乌萨斯常备军交手过无数次了，乌合之众有什么好嚣张的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动术师",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们等着！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（掐断）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样，罗德岛。我们可能要教训下这帮不懂规矩的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "劝你们别插手，我们可不想被判通敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，通敌？你在说什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，在废城发生了什么，罗德岛的官方口吻会怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......什么都没发生。我们和雪怪小队交战，从未有其它整合运动插手过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "演戏？演戏我最擅长了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们一会儿装装样子，然后趁乱把这些人全都解决了，你觉得怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我没意见。你们队长怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请问先生，我该怎么称呼你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃，嗯，小姑娘你长得很可爱，但我们见面时间那么短，我还没做好准备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "准备个头啊！想什么呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪小队成员A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，抱歉！就，就缓和下气氛。就叫雪怪1号怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么雪怪1号先生......我们都有要救的人，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就让我们一起制服那些可能干扰到救援进程的整合运动吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雪怪1号先生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_037",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。我现在非常有干劲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的干劲究竟是从哪来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
